{"id":"ewp-glossary-282","title":"词汇表：交替、端点、调整浪、斜纹浪与双重三浪","type":"term","statement":"交替指浪2与浪4风格常不同；端点是三角形边界交点；调整浪逆大一级趋势；斜纹浪是允许重叠的楔形驱动模式；双重三浪为W-X-Y横向联合。","conditions":[],"invalidations":[],"exceptions":[],"reasoning":"","action":[],"relations":["ewp-guide-alternation","ewp-rule-diagonal","ewp-rule-combination"],"source":{"source_id":"ewp-11-zh-2021","chapter":"词汇表","section":"A-D","book_pages":[282],"pdf_pages":[309],"figures":[],"authority":"supplement"},"confidence":{"level":"high","note":"原书在所列页面直接陈述；已按规则强度和历史语境提炼。"}}
{"id":"ewp-glossary-283","title":"词汇表：双重锯齿、等同、平台、推动与驱动","type":"term","statement":"双重锯齿由W-X-Y两个锯齿连接；等同是非延长驱动浪常见指南；平台为3-3-5；推动为无重叠5-3-5-3-5；驱动包括推动和斜纹。","conditions":[],"invalidations":[],"exceptions":[],"reasoning":"","action":[],"relations":["ewp-guide-wave-equality","ewp-rule-flat","ewp-rule-impulse-core"],"source":{"source_id":"ewp-11-zh-2021","chapter":"词汇表","section":"D-M","book_pages":[283],"pdf_pages":[310],"figures":[],"authority":"supplement"},"confidence":{"level":"high","note":"原书在所列页面直接陈述；已按规则强度和历史语境提炼。"}}
{"id":"ewp-glossary-284","title":"词汇表：一二浪、重叠、前一第四浪、顺势与调整风格","type":"term","statement":"一二、一二是第三浪中心加速前的嵌套结构；重叠指浪4进入浪1区域；前一第四浪常提供调整区域；顺势、陡直和横向描述不同调整表现。","conditions":[],"invalidations":[],"exceptions":[],"reasoning":"","action":[],"relations":["ewp-rule-impulse-core","ewp-guide-correction-depth","ewp-guide-alternation"],"source":{"source_id":"ewp-11-zh-2021","chapter":"词汇表","section":"O-S","book_pages":[284],"pdf_pages":[311],"figures":[],"authority":"supplement"},"confidence":{"level":"high","note":"原书在所列页面直接陈述；已按规则强度和历史语境提炼。"}}
{"id":"ewp-glossary-285","title":"词汇表：第三浪中的第三浪、冲击与三角形","type":"term","statement":"第三浪中的第三浪是推动浪最强中段；冲击是三角形结束后的驱动运动；收缩、屏障和扩散三角形均为A-B-C-D-E的3-3-3-3-3结构，边界关系不同。","conditions":[],"invalidations":[],"exceptions":[],"reasoning":"","action":[],"relations":["ewp-rule-triangle","ewp-guide-triangle","ewp-personality-wave-3"],"source":{"source_id":"ewp-11-zh-2021","chapter":"词汇表","section":"T","book_pages":[285],"pdf_pages":[312],"figures":[],"authority":"supplement"},"confidence":{"level":"high","note":"原书在所列页面直接陈述；已按规则强度和历史语境提炼。"}}
{"id":"ewp-glossary-286","title":"词汇表：三重联合、缩短第五浪与锯齿","type":"term","statement":"三重三浪和三重锯齿以W-X-Y-X-Z连接；缩短第五浪未越过第三浪极值但内部完整；锯齿为5-3-5的A-B-C陡直调整。","conditions":[],"invalidations":[],"exceptions":[],"reasoning":"","action":[],"relations":["ewp-rule-combination","ewp-guide-truncation","ewp-rule-zigzag"],"source":{"source_id":"ewp-11-zh-2021","chapter":"词汇表","section":"T-Z","book_pages":[286],"pdf_pages":[313],"figures":[],"authority":"supplement"},"confidence":{"level":"high","note":"原书在所列页面直接陈述；已按规则强度和历史语境提炼。"}}
